--
g++ 13 (-fsanitize=address,undefined) and clang++ 18 accept this program,
and it fails only its WRONG assertion.  Fixed: the elements, typechecked
here, were typechecked again during V's constructor selection in V's
scope ("member 'dec::bias' is not accessible (protected)").
